<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Sadia</title>
<meta name="description" content="Learning to build things. Sharing the process — code, projects, and whatever I'm figuring out this year.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --ink: #241f1c;
    --ink-soft: #4a423b;
    --blue: rgba(183,201,236,0.46);
    --pink: rgba(243,201,212,0.46);
    --green: rgba(191,227,198,0.5);
    --coral: rgba(234,184,172,0.46);
    --yellow: rgba(245,233,79,0.85);
    --card-bg: rgba(251,248,242,0.34);
    --rule: rgba(36,31,28,0.18);
    --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace;
  }

  *{ box-sizing: border-box; }

  html, body{ margin:0; padding:0; }

  body{
    min-height: 100vh;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--ink);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 40px 16px 60px;
    position: relative;
    background-color: #26221d;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  body::before{
    content: "";
    position: fixed;
    inset: -40px;
    background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,');
    background-repeat: repeat;
    background-size: 620px auto;
    background-position: -60px -40px;
    filter: blur(9px) saturate(1.05);
    transform: scale(1.08);
    z-index: 0;
  }

  body::after{
    content: "";
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background: rgba(20,17,14,0.5);
    z-index: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  main{
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 460px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .browser-chip{
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  /* ---- Panels: each is its own floating card ---- */

  .panel{
    padding: 22px 22px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: var(--card-bg);
    backdrop-filter: blur(9px) saturate(1.1);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(9px) saturate(1.1);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 34px rgba(20,16,12,0.3), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.35) inset;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
  }

  .panel.header{
    background: var(--blue);
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .avatar{
    width: 72px;
    height: 72px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    flex: none;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
  }
  .avatar img{
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .header-text .site{
    display: block;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  h1{
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 28px;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .bio{
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ---- Accordion-style section headers ---- */

  .section-label{
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 14px 22px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    background: var(--green);
    border-radius: 14px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(20,16,12,0.28), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.35) inset;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
    backdrop-filter: blur(9px) saturate(1.1);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(9px) saturate(1.1);
  }
  .section-label.links-label{ background: var(--green); }
  .section-label .chev{ font-size: 13px; }

  /* ---- Links list ---- */

  .panel.links{
    background: var(--pink);
    padding: 14px 16px 20px;
  }

  .links{
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .links a{
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 13px 14px;
    background: rgba(251,248,242,0.28);
    border: 1px solid rgba(36,31,28,0.25);
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 14px;
    transition: background 0.15s ease, transform 0.1s ease;
  }

  .links a:hover, .links a:focus-visible{
    background: rgba(251,248,242,0.55);
    transform: translateX(2px);
  }
  .links a:focus-visible{ outline: 2px solid var(--ink); outline-offset: 1px; }

  .chev-sm{ opacity: 0.6; }

  .link-sub{
    margin-left: auto;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  /* ---- Now panel ---- */

  .panel.now{
    background: var(--coral);
  }
  .now-title{
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
    font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .now-text{
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ---- Footer ---- */

  footer{
    text-align: center;
    padding: 20px 20px 22px;
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border-radius: 14px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(9px) saturate(1.1);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(9px) saturate(1.1);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(20,16,12,0.25), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.3) inset;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
  }
  .highlight{
    background: var(--yellow);
    padding: 3px 8px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    box-decoration-break: clone;
    -webkit-box-decoration-break: clone;
  }

  @media (max-width: 400px){
    .panel.header{ flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    .links a{ transition: none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>

  <div class="panel header">
    <div class="avatar" aria-hidden="true"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt=""></div>
    <div class="header-text">
      <span class="site">sadii.dev</span>
      <h1>Sadia</h1>
      <p class="bio">Learning to build things. Sharing the process — code, projects, and whatever I'm figuring out this year.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-label links-label"><span class="chev">&gt;</span> socials</div>

  <div class="panel links">
    <ul class="links">
      <li>
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/sadia.abg/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <span class="chev-sm">&gt;</span> Instagram <span class="link-sub">@sadia.abg</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@sadi_xyu" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <span class="chev-sm">&gt;</span> TikTok <span class="link-sub">@sadi_xyu</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://open.spotify.com/user/31igcbstr7qfqrxk6ui37aypc7cq" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <span class="chev-sm">&gt;</span> Spotify <span class="link-sub">now playing</span>
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="panel now">
    <div class="now-title"><span class="chev-sm">&gt;</span> now</div>
    <p class="now-text">Building this page, actually — first thing I've shipped this year. More soon.</p>
  </div>

  <footer>
    <span class="highlight">thanks for being here &lt;3</span>
  </footer>

</main>
</body>
</html>
